{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>A voice calling.</b> These are the heralds." "<b>Clear.</b> He says to every nation." "<b>The way of YHWH.</b> The meaning: those who were in exile shall return to the holy mountain, and this is the way of YHWH." "<b>Make straight.</b> The meaning is doubled."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {2 "Resolved יי as YHWH; the manuscript likely reads the abbreviated divine name."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:00.553656226Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}